# Cline Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` (repo root) first — it is the canonical agent guide:
commands, architecture map, invariants, documentation map, and
documentation-maintenance rules.

Then read `memory-bank/activeContext.md` for current work and its archive
index. Open other memory-bank files selectively per the documentation map in
AGENTS.md — do not read all of them for every task.

After making changes, follow the documentation-maintenance rules in AGENTS.md
(update activeContext.md; archive completed work to
memory-bank/previous-work/NNN with an index line).
